source_1 = "record 22.30.167 [doc.29] (stale): gov-state-doc at line 34: The state page assigns No=2, NoWithVeto=3 and Abstain=4; the protobuf enum and validation code assign Abstain=2, No=3 and NoWithVeto=4. Its state sketches also omit weighted vote options and expedited proposal fields."

[page.5]
