source_1 = "record 22.30.167 [doc.30] (stale): gov-message-doc at line 41: The submission pseudocode rejects empty initial deposits and treats title, type and vote counters as direct message/proposal fields; the producer accepts an empty coin list and packs proposal content in Any with weighted vote records."

